From: Chainguard <packaging@chainguard.dev>
Date: Mon, 08 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lib/dpkg/log.c: add missing stdlib.h include for free()

The function log_set_file() calls free() but the file does not include
<stdlib.h>, causing a compilation error with strict warning flags:

  log.c:43:9: error: implicit declaration of function 'free'
              [-Wimplicit-function-declaration]

Add the missing include to fix the build.

diff --git a/lib/dpkg/log.c b/lib/dpkg/log.c
--- a/lib/dpkg/log.c
+++ b/lib/dpkg/log.c
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
 #include <dpkg/dpkg.h>
 #include <dpkg/dpkg-db.h>
 #include <dpkg/fdio.h>
+#include <stdlib.h>
 
 static int log_fd = -1;
 static char *log_file = NULL;
